      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US Real Estate Census Tract, FIPS & PropTech Geo Enricher Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nEnriches U.S. commercial and residential real estate coordinates via official FCC & U.S. Census Bureau APIs (Zero-Key). Extracts 15-digit Block FIPS, 11-digit Census Tract, County FIPS, bounding boxes, and Property Underwriting Scores.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-census-fcc-real-estate-geo-enricher](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-census-fcc-real-estate-geo-enricher)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-census-fcc-real-estate-geo-enricher** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1d923f83-66ca-52b8-8d63-e647d025be2a",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
